msgid "AdvAgg CSS Minify"
msgstr "AdvAgg CSS 合并压缩"

msgid "AdvAgg CSS Minification is disabled."
msgstr "已禁用 AdvAgg CSS 合并压缩。"

msgid "Go to the <a href=\"@settings\">AdvAgg Minify CSS settings page</a> and select a minifier, or go to the <a href=\"@modules\">modules page</a> and disable the \"AdvAgg Minify CSS\" module."
msgstr "转至 <a href=\"@settings\">AdvAgg 缩小 CSS 设置</a>页面并选择一个缩小器，或者转至<a href=\"@modules\">模块页面</a>并禁用“AdvAgg 缩小 CSS”模块。"

msgid "AdvAgg Minify CSS"
msgstr "AdvAgg 合并压缩 CSS"

msgid "Minify CSS."
msgstr "合并压缩 CSS。"

msgid "Advanced CSS/JS Aggregation"
msgstr "高级 CSS/JS 聚合"

msgid "CSS Minification"
msgstr "CSS 合并压缩"

msgid "AdvAgg CSS minification settings."
msgstr "AdvAgg CSS 合并压缩设置。"

msgid "AdvAgg: CSS Minification"
msgstr "AdvAgg：CSS 合并压缩"

msgid "Settings"
msgstr "设置"

msgid "Which minifier to use. 0 is Disabled."
msgstr "要使用的合并压缩工具。 0 表示已禁用。"

msgid "Add licensing information to aggregates for individual source files."
msgstr "将许可信息添加到各源文件的聚合中。"

msgid "The settings below will not have any effect because AdvAgg is currently in <a href=\"@devel\">development mode</a>. Once the cache settings have been set to a non-development level, CSS minification will take place."
msgstr "以下设置将不会产生任何影响，因为 AdvAgg 当前处于<a href=\"@devel\">开发方式</a>。 一旦将高速缓存设置设定为非开发级别，就将进行 CSS 合并压缩。"

msgid "Disabled"
msgstr "已禁用"

msgid "Core"
msgstr "核心"

msgid "YUI Compressor"
msgstr "YUI 压缩器"

msgid "Minification: Select a minifier"
msgstr "合并压缩：选择合并压缩工具"

msgid "Add licensing comments"
msgstr "添加许可注释"

msgid ""
"If unchecked, the Advanced Aggregation module's licensing comments\n"
"      will be omitted from the aggregated files. Omitting the comments will produce somewhat better scores in\n"
"      some automated security scans but otherwise should not affect your site. These are included by default in order to better follow the spirit of the GPL by providing the source for javascript files."
msgstr ""
"如果未选中此选项，那么将在汇总文件中\n"
"省略“高级汇总”模块的许可注释。 省略注释将会在某些自动安全扫描中\n"
"产生更好的分数，但不应影响您的站点。 缺省情况下，将包含这些注释，以便能够通过提供 JavaScript 文件来源更好地遵循 GPL 的精神。"

